                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "As ranking member of the Subcommittee on Highways & Transit, I wrote GAO requesting a study on railway noise pollution, which can cause structural damage and negative health effects.\n\u00a0\nIf there are viable ways to mitigate these harms, we should find and implement them. https://t.co/Lx1CoUMYVM",
