                "text": "DC pays the most in federal income taxes per capita in the nation, yet DC was excluded from a health program in the BBB, likely depriving the District of $100s of millions.\n\u00a0\nI introduced a bill to make DC eligible, the same way states are. https://t.co/qA3CKqNDUC",
